 "provenance": {
  "note": "NOT the output of term-engineering project-glossary-skos. That tool (term-engineering-services-section 0.3.2, commit a6aa3d350af72aa1ebcf3983448071debb231f9c) could not run: its received source imports @red-cup-engineering packages that are not installed or published (metrologic, semiotic-content-address, toml-codec-service, among others). This file projects the same glossary carriers with the tool's documented mapping (README, schema computer-glossary-skos.v3): name -> skos:prefLabel, body -> skos:definition, identity -> skos:notation, concept IRI = https://561.group/knowledge/<scheme path with services/ dropped>/<identity>. Regenerate it with the tool when the tool installs.",
